      "At the last pre-green frame: vehicleID, lane, rank, position, speed, physical gap; retain vehicle type/length only if already recorded.",
      "Per initial vehicle: first sustained movement interval from native speed histories, threshold and persistence rule with sensitivity checks; track continuous lane identity until crossing.",
      "Per rank: onset lag from green, movement onset relative to predecessor, stopbar crossing interval and interval headway; mark arrivals, interleaving and missing data separately.",
      "Per lane: initial count, physical extent, first-vehicle reaction, release-propagation versus rank/distance, rank4 crossing, sustained later-headway window with residual initial queue, and last initial-cohort clearance.",
